https://github.com/eladnava/pikud-haoref-api (commit e40da77a4aab3052fb1a4a56402ae2e26c3e3cf3),
Copyright Elad Nava, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
A copy of that license is in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

That upstream file is a processed cache of Pikud HaOref district and segment
data. Numeric city ids are preserved from it. District ids (district:*) are
assigned by oref-alerts-core and are not official Oref identifiers.
